Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: Mojang ServerLevel 12-arg body for Moonlight mixin

Put full constructor body in Mojang 12-arg signature so Moonlight
WrapOperation finds ServerChunkCache. Bukkit extras via ThreadLocal.
DefaultAttributes NeoForge attribute view retained.

